<title>BOSNIA: SOCCER-BOSNIA BEAT ITALY 2-1 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOSNIA BEAT ITALY 2-1 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>SARAJEVO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bosnia beat Italy 2-1 (halftime 2-1) in a</p>
<p>friendly soccer international on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Bosnia - Hasan Salihamidzic (5), Elvir Bolic (43)</p>
<p>Italy - Enrico Chiesa (11)</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,000</p>
</text>
